SUMMARY
==============================================================================
  Example 1: N = 6, dim_q A = 20, class sizes [2, 3, 3, 3, 3, 6]
  Example 2: N = 2, dim_q A = 4, dim_q C = 20 (paper 10), nN = 14
  Example 3: N = 2, dim_q A = 4, dim_q C = 44 (paper 22), nN = 26
  F_9 isometry witness: Hermitian hull 2 -> 0

  Every number above is derived in this file from the paper's
  definitions; none is copied from an earlier project output.
